#, fuzzy
msgid "Strong Ciphers Only"
msgstr "US सिफर मात्र"

#: crypto.cpp:301
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<li><b>Strong Ciphers Only:</b> Select only the strong (&gt;= 128 bit) "
